ol_test\",\"text\":\"【待补充：试验臂计划最大给药量及其依据：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"},{\"cell_id\":\"c_m_control\",\"row_id\":\"r_maximum\",\"column_id\":\"col_control\",\"text\":\"【待补充：对照臂计划最大给药量及其依据：该项待研究团队确认后补充】\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"note_refs\":[],\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}],\"notes\":[{\"note_id\":\"n1\",\"note_type\":\"definition\",\"text\":\"Q4W=每4周（每28天）；PD=疾病进展；BCMA=B细胞成熟抗原；ADC=抗体偶联药物；Rd=来那度胺/地塞米松。\",\"marker\":\"\",\"marker_source_locator\":\"\",\"source_refs\":[],\"source_kind\":\"\",\"target_ids\":[],\"association_reason\":\"\",\"module_ref\":\"\",\"project_override\":false,\"review_status\":\"ai_draft\"},{\"note_id\":\"n2\",\"note_type\":\"operational\",\"text\":\"合成药K输注液以0.9%氯化钠注射液稀释至250 mL，配制后室温4小时内输注完毕。\",\"marker\":\"\",\"marker_source_locator\":\"\",\"source_refs\":[],\"source_kind\":\"\",\"target_ids\":[],\"association_reason\":\"\",\"module_ref\":\"\",\"project_override\":false,\"review_status\":\"ai_draft\"},{\"note_id\":\"n3\",\"note_type\":\"operational\",\"text\":\"合成药K匹配静脉输注安慰剂为0.9%氯化钠注射液250 mL，避光袋，外观与合成药K输液袋一致，中心药房统一标准操作程序配制，室温放置不超过4小时。\",\"marker\":\"\",\"marker_source_locator\":\"\",\"source_refs\":[],\"source_kind\":\"\",\"target_ids\":[],\"association_reason\":\"\",\"module_ref\":\"\",\"project_override\":false,\"review_status\":\"ai_draft\"},{\"note_id\":\"n4\",\"note_type\":\"condition\",\"text\":\"来那度胺匹配安慰剂为25 mg规格胶囊外观，白色不透明胶囊，无活性成分；地塞米松匹配安慰剂为10 mg规格白色圆形片外观，无活性成分。\",\"marker\":\"\",\"marker_source_locator\":\"\",\"source_refs\":[],\"source_kind\":\"\",\"target_ids\":[],\"association_reason\":\"\",\"module_ref\":\"\",\"project_override\":false,\"review_status\":\"ai_draft\"},{\"note_id\":\"n5\",\"note_type\":\"timing_rule\",\"text\":\"试验臂口服匹配安慰剂：来那度胺匹配安慰剂按第1–21天每日一次；地塞米松匹配安慰剂按第1、8、15、22天各一次。\",\"marker\":\"\",\"marker_source_locator\":\"\",\"source_refs\":[],\"source_kind\":\"\",\"target_ids\":[],\"association_reason\":\"\",\"module_ref\":\"\",\"project_override\":false,\"review_status\":\"ai_draft\"}]}},{\"block_id\":\"v2_n_4_3_p4\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"剂量选择依据：试验臂合成药K按5 mg/kg、每28天周期一次静脉输注；对照臂来那度胺25 mg和地塞米松40 mg按上述口服日程给药。计划最大给药量及其依据【待补充：计划最大给药量及其依据：该项待研究团队确认后补充】；剂量安全边际相关信息【待补充：剂量安全边际相关信息：该项待研究团队确认后补充】；剂量选择与本研究目标人群的联系【待补充：剂量选择与本研究目标人群的联系：该项待研究团队确认后补充】。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"f7486dc83ff4026cea9c107c85a17529d4f02326fb7c97563dedfefb22361548"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:01f55eb04d83f6f6a93d2e5338cf798671b02c92a14f50fb5be000b50a365636:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:01f55eb04d83f6f6a93d2e5338cf798671b02c92a14f50fb5be000b50a365636:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"b6572d7a9a297c325d57a899a9a164ceb02681e4eda184a4ba9a995bc9cb0f84","prompt_sha256":"5322c0235bbedc2213b004747cbd757992154e907fd360b9bf7be0e09db8863e","provider_session_id":"a04533d0-68b2-4629-84fa-0d13958b8edd","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}